@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="row justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-lg-9">
        <h1 class="h3 mb-1">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-muted">Last updated: 9 June 2026</p>

        <div class="alert alert-warning small">
            <strong>Template notice:</strong> this policy is a starting point and must be reviewed by a
            qualified lawyer, and the placeholders (operator name, address, contact email) completed,
            before you collect real user data or take live payments.
        </div>

        <p>
            PremiumMotors ("we", "us") operates an online platform where private sellers list cars and
            registered users make private offers. The actual sale of any vehicle happens directly between
            buyer and seller — we are an introduction service and never a party to the transaction. This
            policy explains what personal data we collect and how we use it.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Who we are</h2>
        <p>
            The data controller is <strong>[Operator legal name]</strong>, <strong>[registered address,
            Albania]</strong>. For any privacy question or request, contact us at
            <strong>[contact email]</strong>.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h5 mt-4">What we collect</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Account details</strong> — your username, email address, phone number, and the password you set.</li>
            <li><strong>Listing content</strong> — the car details, description, photos, country, and asking price you publish.</li>
            <li><strong>Offers</strong> — the amounts you offer on listings (visible only to that listing's seller).</li>
            <li><strong>Advertising records</strong> — if you buy paid placement, the reference, dates and amount. There is no checkout on this site yet and we hold no card details of any kind.</li>
            <li><strong>Technical data</strong> — an essential session cookie that keeps you logged in.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="h5 mt-4">How we use it</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>To operate your account, your listings, offers, and buyer/seller messaging.</li>
            <li>To keep a record of any advertising you have bought from us.</li>
            <li>
                <strong>To connect a buyer and seller once an offer is accepted.</strong> When a seller
                accepts your offer, your <strong>email and phone number are shared with that seller</strong>
                and theirs are shared with you, so the two of you can arrange inspection, payment and
                collection. If your offer is declined or withdrawn, no contact details are ever shared.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>To carry your messages.</strong> Messages you send to a buyer or seller are stored
                and shown to that person. Our administrators can read them for support and abuse handling.
            </li>
            <li>To keep the platform secure and prevent fraud and abuse.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Who we share it with</h2>
        <p>
            We do not sell your personal data. We share it only with: the seller of a listing you win (as
            described above); the companies that host this site, store its photos and send its email; and
            authorities where required by law. There is no payment processor, because there is no checkout.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Legal basis</h2>
        <p>
            Where the EU/UK GDPR applies, we process your data to perform our contract with you (running your
            account and listings), to meet legal obligations, and for our legitimate interests in operating a
            safe marketplace.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Retention</h2>
        <p>
            We keep account and listing data while your account is active, and payment records for as long as
            required by tax and accounting law. We delete or anonymise data when it is no longer needed.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Your rights</h2>
        <p>
            Subject to applicable law, you may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal
            data, object to or restrict certain processing, and request a copy of your data. To exercise any
            of these, contact <strong>[contact email]</strong>.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Changes</h2>
        <p>We may update this policy; we will revise the "last updated" date above when we do.</p>

        <p class="mt-4"><a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Terms">View our Terms of Service →</a></p>
    </div>
</div>
